<title>BELGIUM: Union Miniere returns to profit.</title>
<headline>Union Miniere returns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit		0.391    vs     0.954 loss</p>
<p>    Group current profit	 1.606    vs     1.816</p>
<p>    Extraordinary loss	   0.942    vs     2.207</p>
<p>    Turnover		     131.027    vs   127.351</p>
<p>    Operating profit	     1.722    vs     2.192</p>
<p>    Taxes			    0.352    vs     0.271</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgian non-ferous metals group Union Miniere said it expected 1997 earnings to be better than 1996's.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
